# Stimulus Controllers

## What Exists

### UI & Navigation
- `dropdown_controller` - dropdown menu with click-outside handling
- `modal_controller` - modal open/close
- `flash_controller` - auto-closing flash messages with hover pause

## Conventions

- Always clean up in `disconnect()` - remove event listeners, cancel timers, disconnect observers
- Use Turbo for navigation and form submissions; Stimulus for behavior that Turbo can't handle
- Use `data-action` attributes to bind events, not `addEventListener` in `connect()`
- Targets over DOM queries (`this.elementTarget` not `this.element.querySelector`)
- Keep controllers focused on one behavior

